# The actual degree-four elliptic cap-kernel Wang map and its integral image

The genuine positive-circle cross product of the original surface's third
homology is compared with the original affine mapping torus using the
literal finite-cover square and an actual shear homology calculation.
The complete map is computed in the existing surface and original flat
third-exterior markings, retaining the genuine covering shear.

The map is injective. Its exact image is a congruence sublattice of the
full original monodromy invariants, with cyclic cokernel of order three
or four and an explicit residue formula. These statements concern the
actual cap kernel and actual singular homology, not an assigned homology
presentation or a replacement surface marking.
